A furious fire storm rages around the caster, doing [105, 142, 170, 194, 215 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage in a radius of 3 each turn for [11, 12, 12, 13, 13 (TL1-5; SP 100)] turns.

You closely control the firestorm, preventing it from harming your party members.

The damage and duration will increase with your Spellpower.
